# Kryptic

Fast, concurrent browser automation library for Python — and any language.

## Run examples

```bash
PYTHONPATH=. python3 examples/basic_usage.py
PYTHONPATH=. python3 examples/parallel_scrape.py
PYTHONPATH=. python3 examples/http_mode.py
PYTHONPATH=. python3 examples/detect_browsers.py
PYTHONPATH=. python3 examples/server_mode.py
```

## Start server (for other languages)

```bash
python -m kryptic serve --port 7890 --concurrency 4
```

## Stack

- Python 3.11, Playwright (async), httpx, aiohttp

## Where things live

- `kryptic/` — library source
- `bindings/` — JS, Java, Go, Rust, C, C++ client libraries
- `examples/` — runnable demos
- `README.md` — full documentation
